				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Enable SCM badge counts in workspace settings\n\nAdd `git.countBadge`, `scm.countBadge`, and `scm.graph.badges` all set to `\"all\"` in the root .vscode/settings.json so the Source Control view shows pending change counts on all registered providers.\n\nThis eliminates the need to expand each SCM tree node to see whether there are uncommitted changes, improving at-a-glance awareness in the VS Code sidebar.",
			"SHA": "ebd5a04b791d938872c2b03281f83109b45e9c76"
